---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — Metify" description="Learn about Metify's mission to simplify data center automation.">
  <section class="py-24 bg-brand-darker">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-8">About <span class="text-brand-green">Us</span></h1>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <img src="/images/about/Metify-History.jpg" alt="Metify History" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/about/Metify-Server.jpg" alt="Metify Server Infrastructure" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10" loading="lazy" />
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-6">History</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Founded in 2019, Metify identified a huge gap in the market for an easy to use and intuitive bare metal provisioning solution that addresses common pain points within data center environments:
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-400 mb-10">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Too many OEM specific tools to manage different server assets
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Inefficient use of staff constantly dealing with hardware issues
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Lack of governance and security controls across diverse server platforms
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Inadequate reporting to see who is using specific assets at any given time
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Poor BMC security controls and general lack of BMC traffic introspection
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            No root-of-trust capability across all platforms
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
            Slow server, storage and network provisioning burns valuable staff hours
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Since 2019, Metify has been hard at work developing an optimal solution we now call MOJO. This solution has added groundbreaking features such as:
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Pre-installed iPXE environment requiring no additional reconfiguration
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Multi-OEM agnostic configuration and provisioning across all major server OEMs
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Server locking and auditing to protect production assets from misconfiguration
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Complete server audit trail with easy to generate PDF reports
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Secure DOD decommissioning
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            Root-of-trust hardware attestation
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</Layout>
